      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "5277bfb6594771b2",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 160,
      "quote": "The following are OPTIONAL for DynamoDb Table Encryption Configuration: - [DynamoDB Sort Key Name](#dynamodb-sort-key-name) - [Unauthenticated Attributes](#unauthenticated-attributes) - [Unauthenticated Attribute Name Prefix](#unauthenticated-attribute-prefix) - [Algorithm Suite](#algorithm-suite) - [Legacy Config](#legacy-config) - [Plaintext Policy](#plaintext-policy)",
