      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "a65a12b8d739dba9",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 44,
      "quote": "If the `TableName` in the request does not refer to an [encrypted-table](#encrypted-table), the UpdateItem request MUST be unchanged.",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbEncryptionTransforms/src/UpdateItemTransform.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "validate-before-updateitem",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ef7237d0bc26014",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 69,
      "quote": "After a [UpdateItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_UpdateItem.html) call is made to DynamoDB, the resulting response MUST be modified before being returned to the caller if:",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbEncryptionTransforms/src/UpdateItemTransform.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "aa8da81c7a07f1a8",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 100,
      "quote": "In this case, the [Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md) MUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input [DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item) is the `Attributes` field in the original response",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbEncryptionTransforms/src/UpdateItemTransform.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "b11117e4becdd950",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 108,
      "quote": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result.",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbEncryptionTransforms/src/UpdateItemTransform.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "15518b014ae972a9",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 114,
      "quote": "The UpdateItem response's `Attributes` field MUST be replaced by the encrypted DynamoDb Item outputted above.",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbEncryptionTransforms/src/UpdateItemTransform.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "718e776a713a3f45",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 121,
      "quote": "In all other cases, the UpdateItem response MUST NOT be modified.",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbEncryptionTransforms/src/UpdateItemTransform.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "b3d9b5f29f10b0c7",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 149,
      "quote": "Additionally, if a value of `UPDATED_OLD` or `UPDATED_NEW` was used, and any Attributes in the response are authenticated per the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration), an error MUST be raised.",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbEncryptionTransforms/src/UpdateItemTransform.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "bfc5095fb7229df3",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 50,
      "quote": "On initialization of the DynamoDB Item Encryptor the caller MUST provide: - [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#dynamodb-table-name) - [DynamoDB Partition Key Name](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#dynamodb-partition-key-name) - [Attribute Actions](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#attribute-actions) - A [CMM](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#cmm) or [Keyring](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#keyring)",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbItemEncryptor/Model/DynamoDbItemEncryptor.smithy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-item-encryptor.md",
      "target_section": "initialization",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "932f21eac306fce6",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 59,
      "quote": "The following are OPTIONAL for the DynamoDB Item Encryptor: - [DynamoDB Sort Key Name](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#dynamodb-sort-key-name) - [Unauthenticated Attributes](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attributes) - [Unauthenticated Attribute Name Prefix](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attribute-prefix) - [Algorithm Suite](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#algorithm-suite) - [Legacy Config](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-config) - [Plaintext Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#plaintext-policy)",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbItemEncryptor/Model/DynamoDbItemEncryptor.smithy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-item-encryptor.md",
      "target_section": "initialization",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "a238bd20b91f9d6b",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 73,
      "quote": "This Partition Key Name MUST be a valid DynamoDB Key Schema Attribute Name",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbItemEncryptor/Model/DynamoDbItemEncryptor.smithy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config.md",
      "target_section": "dynamodb-partition-key-name",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
