      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 325,
      "quote": "If this item has a Sort Key attribute, the DynamoDB Item Base Context MUST contain: - the key \"aws-crypto-sort-name\" with a value equal to the [DynamoDB Sort Key Name](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#dynamodb-sort-key-name).",
