    {
      "id": "93da3749e13ab20e",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 552,
      "quote": "The [Attributes Actions](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#attribute-actions) configured on this Item Encryptor MUST specify a Crypto Action for every attribute in the [input DynamoDB Item](#dynamodb-item) (Attribute Actions MAY specify a Crypto Action for an attribute not in the input DynamoDB Item).",
