      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 151,
      "quote": "If not supplied during initialization, the CMM considered \"configured\" to this Item Encryptor MUST be a [default CMM](https://github.com/awslabs/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/blob/master/framework/default-cmm.md) constructed using the [supplied keyring](#keyring) as input.",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbItemEncryptor/src/Index.dfy",
