      "id": "93856d8108c89fce",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 250,
      "quote": "Then, this operation MUST create a [Required Encryption Context CMM](https://github.com/awslabs/private-aws-encryption-sdk-specification-staging/blob/dafny-verified/framework/required-encryption-context-cmm.md) with the following inputs:",
