      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "66ecd33b01565ac8",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 278,
      "quote": "The Legend MUST be named \"aws-crypto-legend\" and be a string with one character per attribute added above, with a one-to-one correspondence with the attributes sorted by their UTF8 encoding, each character designating the original type of the attribute, to allow reversing of the [encoding](../dynamodb-encryption-client/encrypt-item.md#base-context-value-version-2). - 'S' if the attribute was of type String - 'N' if the attribute was of type Number - 'L' if the attribute was of type Null or Boolean - 'B' otherwise",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbItemEncryptor/test/DynamoDBItemEncryptorTest.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "create-new-encryption-context-and-cmm",
      "type": "TEST"
    },
    {
      "id": "5e4bcb12733b0a41",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 589,
      "quote": "If no [Crypto Action](./structures.md#crypto-action) is configured to be [SIGN_AND_INCLUDE_IN_ENCRYPTION_CONTEXT Crypto Action](./structures.md#sign_and_include_in_encryption_context) then the input cmm and encryption context MUST be used unchanged.",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/DynamoDbItemEncryptor/test/DynamoDBItemEncryptorTest.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
