    {
      "id": "be7885ff4990fce0",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 223,
      "quote": "Type ID indicates what type a DynamoDB Attribute Value MUST be serialized and deserialized as. | Attribute Value Data Type | Terminal Type ID | | ------------------------- | ---------------- | | Null (NULL)               | 0x0000           | | String (S)                | 0x0001           | | Number (N)                | 0x0002           | | Binary (B)                | 0xFFFF           | | Boolean (BOOL)            | 0x0004           | | String Set (SS)           | 0x0101           | | Number Set (NS)           | 0x0102           | | Binary Set (BS)           | 0x01FF           | | Map (M)                   | 0x0200           | | List (L)                  | 0x0300           |",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/StructuredEncryption/src/Util.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-attribute-serialization.md",
      "target_section": "type-id",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "000a2e00d017d1e1",
      "level": "Auto",
      "line": 285,
      "quote": "The value MUST be the UTF8 Encoding of the [Base 64 encoded](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4648), of the concatenation of the bytes `typeID + serializedValue` where `typeId` is the attribute's [type ID](./ddb-attribute-serialization.md#type-id) and `serializedValue` is the attribute's value serialized according to [Attribute Value Serialization](./ddb-attribute-serialization.md#attribute-value-serialization).",
      "source": "DynamoDbEncryption/dafny/StructuredEncryption/src/Util.dfy",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/encrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "base-context-value-version-1",
      "type": "IMPLICATION"
    },
    {
