      "line": 143,
      "quote": "If a [Legacy Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-policy) of `FORBID_LEGACY_ENCRYPT_FORBID_LEGACY_DECRYPT` is configured, and the input item [is an item written in the legacy format](#determining-legacy-items), this operation MUST fail.",
