    },
    {
      "comment": "- If the field \"aws-crypto-legend\" exists in the encryption context,\nit MUST [deserialize](./ddb-attribute-serialization.md), all values with keys beginning \"aws-crypto-attr.\",\nand create a Key with these values, using names with the \"aws-crypto-attr.\" removed.\n",
