      "level": "Must",
      "line": 64,
      "quote": "- If the field \"aws-crypto-legend\" exists in the encryption context, it MUST [deserialize](./ddb-attribute-serialization.md), all values with keys beginning \"aws-crypto-attr.\", and create a Key with these values, using names with the \"aws-crypto-attr.\" removed.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-encryption-branch-key-id-supplier/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-encryption-branch-key-id-supplier.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
