      "quote": "DynamoDB API calls MUST have the following modified behavior:",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/api-modification.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "api-modification",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The [Allowed Passthrough DynamoDB APIs](#allowed-passthrough-dynamodb-apis)\nMUST NOT be modified.\n",
      "id": "bca305ca408f3ba0",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 42,
      "quote": "The [Allowed Passthrough DynamoDB APIs](#allowed-passthrough-dynamodb-apis) MUST NOT be modified.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/api-modification.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "api-modification",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Any DynamoDB API not specified is this document either\nMUST NOT be callable or MUST yield an error,\nand that error SHOULD indicate that the operation\nis not supported with DynamoDB client-side encryption.\n",
      "id": "fff4b7fa0c865ea1",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 49,
      "quote": "Any DynamoDB API not specified is this document either MUST NOT be callable or MUST yield an error, and that error SHOULD indicate that the operation is not supported with DynamoDB client-side encryption.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/api-modification.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "api-modification",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For each list item under each key in `Responses`,\nif there is a configured Item Encryptor with [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name) equal to the key,\nthat Item Encryptor MUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input\n[DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item)\nis the `Item` field in the original response.\n",
      "id": "76b4808805e4c500",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 23,
      "quote": "For each list item under each key in `Responses`, if there is a configured Item Encryptor with [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name) equal to the key, that Item Encryptor MUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input [DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item) is the `Item` field in the original response.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-batchgetitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-batchgetitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result.\n",
      "id": "2da6b7058954468d",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 33,
      "quote": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-batchgetitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-batchgetitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Each of these items on the original response MUST be replaced\nwith a value that is equivalent to\nthis result.\n",
      "id": "8eb80e4cf474014f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 39,
      "quote": "Each of these items on the original response MUST be replaced with a value that is equivalent to this result.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-batchgetitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-batchgetitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If any [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) operation fails,\nBatchGetItem MUST yield an error.\n",
      "id": "6bd91537cd497d5e",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 47,
      "quote": "If any [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) operation fails, BatchGetItem MUST yield an error.",
