      "target_section": "decrypt-after-batchgetitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "After a [DeleteItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_DeleteItem.html)\ncall is made to DynamoDB,\nthe resulting response MUST be modified before\nbeing returned to the caller if:\n",
      "id": "bbb0acae730dc775",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 29,
      "quote": "After a [DeleteItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_DeleteItem.html) call is made to DynamoDB, the resulting response MUST be modified before being returned to the caller if:",
