      "quote": "After a [GetItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_GetItem.html) call is made to DynamoDB, the resulting response MUST be modified before being returned to the caller if there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration) with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name) equal to the `TableName` on the GetItem request.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-getitem.toml",
