    {
      "comment": "For each list entry in `Items` in the response,\nif there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the\n[DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration)\nwith a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name)\nequal to the `TableName` on the request,\nthe corresponding Item Encryptor MUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md)\nwhere the input [DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item)\nis this list entry.\n",
      "id": "0f5e1a3d7e9d9861",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 25,
      "quote": "For each list entry in `Items` in the response, if there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration) with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name) equal to the `TableName` on the request, the corresponding Item Encryptor MUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input [DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item) is this list entry.",
