    },
    {
      "comment": "Each of these entries on the original response MUST be replaced\nwith the resulting decrypted\n[DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item-1).\n",
      "id": "d321aa3764710125",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 39,
      "quote": "Each of these entries on the original response MUST be replaced with the resulting decrypted [DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item-1).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-scan.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-scan",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If any [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) operation fails,\nScan MUST yield an error.\n",
      "id": "8b574deeb4d0a404",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 47,
      "quote": "If any [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) operation fails, Scan MUST yield an error.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-scan.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-scan",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The resulting decrypted response MUST be [filtered](ddb-support.md#scanoutputforbeacons) from the result.\n",
      "id": "bbcbba70148e82a0",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 54,
      "quote": "The resulting decrypted response MUST be [filtered](ddb-support.md#scanoutputforbeacons) from the result.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-scan.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-scan",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For each list item under each key in `Responses`,\nif there exists an Item Encryptor specified within\nthe [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration)\nwith a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name)\nequal to the key,\nthe Item Encryptor that corresponds to the key in the request\nMUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input\n[DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item) is the `Item` in the original response.\n",
      "id": "22afa0002a505503",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 25,
      "quote": "For each list item under each key in `Responses`, if there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration) with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name) equal to the key, the Item Encryptor that corresponds to the key in the request MUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input [DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item) is the `Item` in the original response.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-transactgetitems.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-transactgetitems",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result.\n",
      "id": "063bafd5e3f395d1",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 38,
      "quote": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-transactgetitems.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-transactgetitems",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Each of these items on the original response MUST be replaced\nwith a value that is equivalent to the resulting item.\n",
      "id": "437fb08ef9c5b89e",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 44,
      "quote": "Each of these items on the original response MUST be replaced with a value that is equivalent to the resulting item.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-transactgetitems.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-transactgetitems",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If any [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) fails,\nTransactGetItems MUST yield an error.\n",
      "id": "920814a579e3f014",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 51,
      "quote": "If any [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) fails, TransactGetItems MUST yield an error.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-transactgetitems.toml",
