      "target_section": "decrypt-after-transactgetitems",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "After a [UpdateItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_UpdateItem.html)\ncall is made to DynamoDB,\nthe resulting response MUST be modified before\nbeing returned to the caller if:\n",
      "id": "325ead66d2d6ad6e",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 40,
      "quote": "After a [UpdateItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_UpdateItem.html) call is made to DynamoDB, the resulting response MUST be modified before being returned to the caller if:",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-updateitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "In this case, the [Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md) MUST perform\n[Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input\n[DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item)\nis the `Attributes` field in the original response\n",
      "id": "f493d85bc8bcee01",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 49,
      "quote": "In this case, the [Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md) MUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input [DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item) is the `Attributes` field in the original response",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-updateitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result.\n",
      "id": "5bd8491ed93dfa4b",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 58,
      "quote": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-updateitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The UpdateItem response's `Attributes` field MUST be\nreplaced by the encrypted DynamoDb Item outputted above.\n",
      "id": "8d1749b2e91ecb28",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 64,
      "quote": "The UpdateItem response's `Attributes` field MUST be replaced by the encrypted DynamoDb Item outputted above.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-updateitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "In all other cases, the UpdateItem response MUST NOT be modified.\n",
      "id": "a89023ec7742fd06",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 71,
      "quote": "In all other cases, the UpdateItem response MUST NOT be modified.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-updateitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Additionally, if a value of `UPDATED_OLD` or `UPDATED_NEW` was used,\nand any Attributes in the response are authenticated\nper the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration),\nan error MUST be raised.\n",
      "id": "5417d6defab40aac",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 77,
      "quote": "Additionally, if a value of `UPDATED_OLD` or `UPDATED_NEW` was used, and any Attributes in the response are authenticated per the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration), an error MUST be raised.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/decrypt-after-updateitem.toml",
