      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the [Beacon Key Source](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-source)\nis a [Single Key Store](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#single-key-store-initialization)\nthe [Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md) MUST perform\n[Encrypt Item](./encrypt-item.md),\nwhere the input [DynamoDB Item](./encrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item)\nis output of [adding the signed beacons](ddb-support.md#addsignedbeacons) operation.\n",
      "id": "638d2962f3766ef5",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 110,
      "quote": "If the [Beacon Key Source](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-source) is a [Single Key Store](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#single-key-store-initialization) the [Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md) MUST perform [Encrypt Item](./encrypt-item.md), where the input [DynamoDB Item](./encrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item) is output of [adding the signed beacons](ddb-support.md#addsignedbeacons) operation.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/encrypt-before-putitem.toml",
