    },
    {
      "comment": "If the [Beacon Key Source](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-source)\nis a [Multi Key Store](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#multi-key-store-initialization)\nand a `branch key id` was returned from [handling the beacon key field name](ddb-support.md#handlebeaconkeyfieldname)\nthis `branch key id` MUST match the value\nreturned from [Get beacon key id from Parsed Header](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-id-from-parsed-header).\n",
      "id": "27305ee487a1eedd",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 121,
      "quote": "If the [Beacon Key Source](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-source) is a [Multi Key Store](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#multi-key-store-initialization) and a `branch key id` was returned from [handling the beacon key field name](ddb-support.md#handlebeaconkeyfieldname) this `branch key id` MUST match the value returned from [Get beacon key id from Parsed Header](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-id-from-parsed-header).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/encrypt-before-putitem.toml",
