    {
      "comment": "If any of the above fails,\nthe client MUST NOT make a network call to DynamoDB,\nand PutItem MUST yield an error.\n",
      "id": "ffbc35856e230b7e",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 137,
      "quote": "If any of the above fails, the client MUST NOT make a network call to DynamoDB, and PutItem MUST yield an error.",
