      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The PutItem request's `Item` field MUST be replaced\nwith a value that is equivalent to\nthe output of the [add encrypted beacons](ddb-support.md#addencryptedbeacons) operation\ncalculated above.\n",
      "id": "e741c61897b439d3",
