    },
    {
      "comment": "There MUST be some process by which\nthe customer can create this AWS SDK with\nadditional encryption behavior, which\nthis document will refer to as a [DynamoDB Encryption Client](#dynamodb-encryption-client).\n",
      "id": "73de3285e1f82416",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 44,
      "quote": "There MUST be some process by which the customer can create this AWS SDK with additional encryption behavior, which this document will refer to as a [DynamoDB Encryption Client](#dynamodb-encryption-client).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/overview.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "overview",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "There is no restriction on what this process is,\nother than the fact that at some point the customer\nMUST specify a [DynamoDB Encryption Client Configuration](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration).\n",
      "id": "a4639c8144612f2a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 53,
      "quote": "There is no restriction on what this process is, other than the fact that at some point the customer MUST specify a [DynamoDB Encryption Client Configuration](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/overview.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "overview",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This configuration MUST be the configuration ultimately used by\nthe behaviors within the DynamoDB Encryption Client.\n",
      "id": "7b675e1dfd408dcb",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 61,
      "quote": "This configuration MUST be the configuration ultimately used by the behaviors within the DynamoDB Encryption Client.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/overview.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "overview",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For AWS SDKs that do not support an idiomatic way to hook new\nbehavior before and after API calls,\nthis MAY be implemented by providing an\nimplementation of AWS SDK APIs that wrap\nthe relevant APIs with the necessary encryption and decryption logic.\n",
      "id": "bfb1f2c2ea8bc010",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 68,
      "quote": "For AWS SDKs that do not support an idiomatic way to hook new behavior before and after API calls, this MAY be implemented by providing an implementation of AWS SDK APIs that wrap the relevant APIs with the necessary encryption and decryption logic.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/overview.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "overview",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This new implementation SHOULD be a drop-in replacement of the\nregular AWS SDK.\n",
      "id": "0e4cda5422eb66b5",
      "level": "Should",
      "line": 78,
      "quote": "This new implementation SHOULD be a drop-in replacement of the regular AWS SDK.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/overview.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "overview",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The request MUST fail, and the client make no network call to DynamoDB,\nif there exists an Item Encryptor\nspecified within the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration)\nwith a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name)\nequal to table named in any of the `Statements` of the request.\n",
      "id": "c162153563f544c1",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 18,
      "quote": "The request MUST fail, and the client make no network call to DynamoDB, if there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration) with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name) equal to table named in any of the `Statements` of the request.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/validate-before-batchexecutestatement.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "validate-before-batchexecutestatement",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If no such Item Encryptor exists,\nthere MUST NOT be any modification\nto the BatchExecuteStatement request.\n",
      "id": "57d03c8404d8ca7e",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 28,
      "quote": "If no such Item Encryptor exists, there MUST NOT be any modification to the BatchExecuteStatement request.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/validate-before-batchexecutestatement.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "validate-before-batchexecutestatement",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the `TableName` in the request does not refer to an [encrypted-table](#encrypted-table),\nthe DeleteItem request MUST be unchanged.\n",
      "id": "ec2d0604592eff16",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 20,
      "quote": "If the `TableName` in the request does not refer to an [encrypted-table](#encrypted-table), the DeleteItem request MUST be unchanged.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/validate-before-deleteitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "validate-before-deleteitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The DeleteItem request MUST NOT refer to any legacy parameters,\nspecifically Expected and ConditionalOperator MUST NOT be set.\n",
      "id": "bbd30be7c12ae4cf",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 27,
      "quote": "The DeleteItem request MUST NOT refer to any legacy parameters, specifically Expected and ConditionalOperator MUST NOT be set.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/validate-before-deleteitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "validate-before-deleteitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The ConditionExpression MUST be [valid](ddb-support.md#testconditionexpression).\n",
      "id": "11fdabc22a7a70df",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 34,
      "quote": "The ConditionExpression MUST be [valid](ddb-support.md#testconditionexpression).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/validate-before-deleteitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "validate-before-deleteitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If all of the above validation succeeds, the DeleteItem request MUST be unchanged.\n",
      "id": "d7e7d3725f2b3920",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 40,
      "quote": "If all of the above validation succeeds, the DeleteItem request MUST be unchanged.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/validate-before-deleteitem.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "validate-before-deleteitem",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The request MUST fail, and the client make no network call to DynamoDB,\nif there exists an Item Encryptor\nspecified within the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration)\nwith a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name)\nequal to table named in the request.\n",
      "id": "6a2e6ae0c00cec59",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 18,
      "quote": "The request MUST fail, and the client make no network call to DynamoDB, if there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration) with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name) equal to table named in the request.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration/validate-before-executestatement.toml",
