      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-sdk-integration.md",
      "target_section": "validate-before-executestatement",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The request MUST fail, and the client make no network call to DynamoDB,\nif there exists an Item Encryptor\nspecified within the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration)\nwith a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name)\nequal to table named in any of the `TransactStatements` of the request.\n",
      "id": "727453ed2eb959f4",
      "level": "Must",
