      "quote": "The request MUST fail, and the client make no network call to DynamoDB, if there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration) with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name) equal to table named in any of the `TransactStatements` of the request.",
