    },
    {
      "comment": "AddSignedBeacons MUST only operate on [compound beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#compound-beacon)\nthat do not have any [encrypted parts](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#compound-beacon-initialization).\n",
      "id": "e93b2e6cece46e85",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 26,
      "quote": "AddSignedBeacons MUST only operate on [compound beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#compound-beacon) that do not have any [encrypted parts](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#compound-beacon-initialization).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/addsignedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "addsignedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For every configured compound beacons which only contains non encrypted parts\nthat can be successfully built from the attributes in the input AttributeMap,\nAddSignedBeacons MUST add an attribute named NAME,\nwhere NAME is the name of the beacon.\n",
      "id": "50d17b97f6252433",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 33,
      "quote": "For every configured compound beacons which only contains non encrypted parts that can be successfully built from the attributes in the input AttributeMap, AddSignedBeacons MUST add an attribute named NAME, where NAME is the name of the beacon.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/addsignedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "addsignedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The value of this attribute MUST be a string,\nand must have the value defined in [beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#beacon-value).\n",
      "id": "05863955fb60cf5f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 42,
      "quote": "The value of this attribute MUST be a string, and must have the value defined in [beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#beacon-value).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/addsignedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "addsignedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the attribute NAME already exists,\nif the constructed compound beacon does not match\nthe existing attribute value AddSignedBeacons MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "7a2b82230db148ea",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 49,
      "quote": "If the attribute NAME already exists, if the constructed compound beacon does not match the existing attribute value AddSignedBeacons MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/addsignedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "addsignedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "AddSignedBeacons MUST also add an attribute with name `aws_dbe_v_1` and whose value is a string containing a single space.\n",
      "id": "ff89d8c800fd3005",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 57,
      "quote": "AddSignedBeacons MUST also add an attribute with name `aws_dbe_v_1` and whose value is a string containing a single space.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/addsignedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "addsignedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The result of AddSignedBeacons MUST be a super set of everything in the input AttributeMap.\n",
      "id": "2ddec650114f085a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 63,
      "quote": "The result of AddSignedBeacons MUST be a super set of everything in the input AttributeMap.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/addsignedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "addsignedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "To obtain [Beacon Key Materials] GetEncryptedBeacons\nMUST call [Get beacon key after encrypt](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-after-encrypt).\n",
      "id": "b695ab20ce5ca02c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 24,
      "quote": "To obtain [Beacon Key Materials] GetEncryptedBeacons MUST call [Get beacon key after encrypt](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-after-encrypt).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/getencryptedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "getencryptedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "GetEncryptedBeacons MUST NOT operate on [compound beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#compound-beacon)\nthat only have [signed parts](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#compound-beacon-initialization).\n",
      "id": "88268efe292a7d62",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 31,
      "quote": "GetEncryptedBeacons MUST NOT operate on [compound beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#compound-beacon) that only have [signed parts](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#compound-beacon-initialization).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/getencryptedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "getencryptedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For all other configured beacons\nthat can be successfully built from the attributes in the input AttributeMap,\nGetEncryptedBeacons MUST add an attribute named aws_dbe_b_NAME,\nwhere NAME is the name of the beacon.\n",
      "id": "2c898778aab3f7bd",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 38,
      "quote": "For all other configured beacons that can be successfully built from the attributes in the input AttributeMap, GetEncryptedBeacons MUST add an attribute named aws_dbe_b_NAME, where NAME is the name of the beacon.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/getencryptedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "getencryptedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The value of this attribute MUST be a string,\nand must have the value defined in [beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#beacon-value)\n",
      "id": "fc7907bc84e35e1f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 47,
      "quote": "The value of this attribute MUST be a string, and must have the value defined in [beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#beacon-value)",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/getencryptedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "getencryptedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The result of GetEncryptedBeacons MUST NOT contain any keys\nin the [Encrypt Item Output](./encrypt-item.md#output) AttributeMap.\n",
      "id": "ffbbcf99185f28af",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 54,
      "quote": "The result of GetEncryptedBeacons MUST NOT contain any keys in the [Encrypt Item Output](./encrypt-item.md#output) AttributeMap.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/getencryptedbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "getencryptedbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The [Beacon Key Source](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-source)\nMUST be [Multi Key Store](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#multi-key-store-initialization)\nor HandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "1b86e647d22dc73b",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 46,
      "quote": "The [Beacon Key Source](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-source) MUST be [Multi Key Store](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#multi-key-store-initialization) or HandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/handlebeaconkeyfieldname.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "handlebeaconkeyfieldname",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the AttributeMap does not have a key\nequal to [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name)\nHandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST return a `beacon key id` of None\nand the unaltered AttributeMap.\n",
      "id": "adee144384a465f4",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 54,
      "quote": "If the AttributeMap does not have a key equal to [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name) HandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST return a `beacon key id` of None and the unaltered AttributeMap.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/handlebeaconkeyfieldname.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "handlebeaconkeyfieldname",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the AttributeMap does have a key\nequal to [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name)\nthen the `beacon key id` MUST be the value of this Attribute.\n",
      "id": "40bd9c785005ff82",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 63,
      "quote": "If the AttributeMap does have a key equal to [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name) then the `beacon key id` MUST be the value of this Attribute.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/handlebeaconkeyfieldname.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "handlebeaconkeyfieldname",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If there is not an [Attribute Action](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#attribute-actions)\nconfigured for the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name)\nHandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST remove the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name)\nfrom the AttributeMap and return the `beacon key id` and the altered AttributeMap.\n",
      "id": "5f1c3cf5e9a27305",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 71,
      "quote": "If there is not an [Attribute Action](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#attribute-actions) configured for the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name) HandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST remove the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name) from the AttributeMap and return the `beacon key id` and the altered AttributeMap.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/handlebeaconkeyfieldname.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "handlebeaconkeyfieldname",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If there is an [Attribute Action](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#attribute-actions)\nconfigured for the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name)\nand that action is [DO_NOTHING](../structured-encryption/structures.md#do_nothing)\nHandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST remove the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name)\nfrom the AttributeMap and return the `beacon key id` and the altered AttributeMap.\n",
      "id": "ad4f78987ca60cd1",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 80,
      "quote": "If there is an [Attribute Action](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#attribute-actions) configured for the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name) and that action is [DO_NOTHING](../structured-encryption/structures.md#do_nothing) HandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST remove the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name) from the AttributeMap and return the `beacon key id` and the altered AttributeMap.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/handlebeaconkeyfieldname.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "handlebeaconkeyfieldname",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If there is an [Attribute Action](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#attribute-actions)\nconfigured for the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name)\nand that action is [SIGN_ONLY](../structured-encryption/structures.md#sign_only)\nHandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST return the `beacon key id`\nand the unaltered AttributeMap.\n",
      "id": "976aca04b431e74c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 90,
      "quote": "If there is an [Attribute Action](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#attribute-actions) configured for the [Beacon Key Field Name](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-field-name) and that action is [SIGN_ONLY](../structured-encryption/structures.md#sign_only) HandleBeaconKeyFieldName MUST return the `beacon key id` and the unaltered AttributeMap.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/handlebeaconkeyfieldname.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "handlebeaconkeyfieldname",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The KeyConditions property MUST NOT be defined on [QueryInput](#queryinput).\n",
      "id": "cd44810c0bc4ea79",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 53,
      "quote": "The KeyConditions property MUST NOT be defined on [QueryInput](#queryinput).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryinputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryinputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the [QueryObject has encrypted values](#queryobject-has-encrypted-values)\nthen QueryInputForBeacons MUST obtain [Beacon Key Materials](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials)\nfrom [Get beacon key for query](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-for-query).\n",
      "id": "2c9a51b5b2faf72b",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 59,
      "quote": "If the [QueryObject has encrypted values](#queryobject-has-encrypted-values) then QueryInputForBeacons MUST obtain [Beacon Key Materials](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials) from [Get beacon key for query](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-for-query).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryinputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryinputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the [QueryObject does not have encrypted values](#queryobject-has-encrypted-values)\nthen QueryInputForBeacons MUST NOT attempt to obtain [Beacon Key Materials](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials).\n",
      "id": "1c7e45cc84a094be",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 67,
      "quote": "If the [QueryObject does not have encrypted values](#queryobject-has-encrypted-values) then QueryInputForBeacons MUST NOT attempt to obtain [Beacon Key Materials](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryinputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryinputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For any operand in the KeyConditionExpression or FilterExpression which is a beacon name,\nthe name MUST be replaced by the internal beacon name (i.e.\n",
      "id": "fbdbecd7ed62552e",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 74,
      "quote": "For any operand in the KeyConditionExpression or FilterExpression which is a beacon name, the name MUST be replaced by the internal beacon name (i.e.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryinputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryinputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the name is used directly in the expression, the name MUST be changed in the expression.\n",
      "id": "4f1e42e558646f56",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 81,
      "quote": "If the name is used directly in the expression, the name MUST be changed in the expression.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryinputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryinputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the name is used indirectly through the ExpressionAttributeNames mapping,\nthe name MUST be changed in the ExpressionAttributeNames.\n",
      "id": "1a71afeeadb19dac",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 87,
      "quote": "If the name is used indirectly through the ExpressionAttributeNames mapping, the name MUST be changed in the ExpressionAttributeNames.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryinputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryinputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Similarly, any values in ExpressionAttributeValues that are referred to by a beacon name\nMUST be changed to the beacon value, as calculated defined in [beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#beacon-value).\n",
      "id": "8de4534e8914f258",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 94,
      "quote": "Similarly, any values in ExpressionAttributeValues that are referred to by a beacon name MUST be changed to the beacon value, as calculated defined in [beacons](../searchable-encryption/beacons.md#beacon-value).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryinputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryinputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The [hmac key](./search-config.md#hmac-key-generation) used\nMUST be obtained from the [Beacon Key Materials](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials)\n[HMAC Keys map](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#hmac-keys) using the beacon name\nas the key.\n",
      "id": "dfc91053c78921f3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 101,
      "quote": "The [hmac key](./search-config.md#hmac-key-generation) used MUST be obtained from the [Beacon Key Materials](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials) [HMAC Keys map](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#hmac-keys) using the beacon name as the key.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryinputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryinputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a single value in ExpressionAttributeValues is used in more than one context,\nfor example an expression of `this = :foo OR that = :foo` where `this` and `that`\nare both beacons, this operation MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "ee877282c38fe245",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 110,
      "quote": "If a single value in ExpressionAttributeValues is used in more than one context, for example an expression of `this = :foo OR that = :foo` where `this` and `that` are both beacons, this operation MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryinputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryinputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If there are any ExpressionAttributeValues that are referred to by\na beacon name that contain encrypted values (ENCRYPT_AND_SIGN field)\nthen QueryObject has encrypted values MUST return true.\n",
      "id": "c852d34ace60f2de",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 12,
      "quote": "If there are any ExpressionAttributeValues that are referred to by a beacon name that contain encrypted values (ENCRYPT_AND_SIGN field) then QueryObject has encrypted values MUST return true.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryobject-has-encrypted-values.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryobject-has-encrypted-values",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Otherwise it MUST return false.\n",
      "id": "a5849f1a8d18217f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 20,
      "quote": "Otherwise it MUST return false.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryobject-has-encrypted-values.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryobject-has-encrypted-values",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the [QueryObject does not have encrypted values](#queryobject-has-encrypted-values)\nthen QueryOutputForBeacons MUST not filter the results and MUST return.\n",
      "id": "cb7fdc82b9b8464f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 54,
      "quote": "If the [QueryObject does not have encrypted values](#queryobject-has-encrypted-values) then QueryOutputForBeacons MUST not filter the results and MUST return.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryoutputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryoutputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the [Beacon Key Source](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-source) for the configured table\nis a [Multi Key Store](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#multi-key-store-initialization)\nyou MUST construct an `expected beacon key id` equal to the [Beacon Key Id](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials)\non materials obtained from [Get beacon key for query](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-for-query)\nThese [Beacon Key Materials](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials)\nSHOULD then be discarded.\n",
      "id": "dbdfba8bf15eb35f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 61,
      "quote": "If the [Beacon Key Source](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-source) for the configured table is a [Multi Key Store](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#multi-key-store-initialization) you MUST construct an `expected beacon key id` equal to the [Beacon Key Id](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials) on materials obtained from [Get beacon key for query](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-for-query) These [Beacon Key Materials](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#beacon-key-materials) SHOULD then be discarded.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryoutputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryoutputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Using the constructed `expected beacon key id`,\nfor each item the result\nthe [Get beacon key id from Parsed Header](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-id-from-parsed-header)\nMUST match the `expected beacon key id`.\n",
      "id": "fe862f54453326eb",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 72,
      "quote": "Using the constructed `expected beacon key id`, for each item the result the [Get beacon key id from Parsed Header](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-id-from-parsed-header) MUST match the `expected beacon key id`.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryoutputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryoutputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If [Get beacon key id from Parsed Header](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-id-from-parsed-header)\nfails or an item does not match it MUST be discarded.\n",
      "id": "a8769df721a16395",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 81,
      "quote": "If [Get beacon key id from Parsed Header](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md#get-beacon-key-id-from-parsed-header) fails or an item does not match it MUST be discarded.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support/queryoutputforbeacons.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-support.md",
      "target_section": "queryoutputforbeacons",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For each item, we MUST evaluate the query expressions supplied in the QueryInput\nagainst the decrypted field values returned by the query.\n",
      "id": "7d22580f2be0afea",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 88,
      "quote": "For each item, we MUST evaluate the query expressions supplied in the QueryInput against the decrypted field values returned by the query.",
