      "target_section": "dynamodb-table-name",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "if the [configuration version](#configuration-version) is 2, then\nthe key action MUST be [SIGN_AND_INCLUDE_IN_ENCRYPTION_CONTEXT](../structured-encryption/structures.md#contextandsign);\notherwise, the key action MUST be [SIGN_ONLY](../structured-encryption/structures.md#signonly).\n",
      "id": "e4c2d3959cfcec38",
      "level": "Must",
