      "quote": "if the [configuration version](#configuration-version) is 2, then the key action MUST be [SIGN_AND_INCLUDE_IN_ENCRYPTION_CONTEXT](../structured-encryption/structures.md#contextandsign); otherwise, the key action MUST be [SIGN_ONLY](../structured-encryption/structures.md#signonly).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config/key-action.toml",
