      "target_section": "plaintext-policy",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The physical [DynamoDB Table Name](#dynamodb-table-name) is REQUIRED\nto be associated with the DynamoDb Table Encryption Configuration.\n",
      "id": "918f985315ed4cab",
