      "target_section": "structure",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The following are REQUIRED for DynamoDb Table Encryption Configuration:\n",
      "id": "e8429367a1d6d09b",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 43,
      "quote": "The following are REQUIRED for DynamoDb Table Encryption Configuration:",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config/structure.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config.md",
      "target_section": "structure",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The following are OPTIONAL for DynamoDb Table Encryption Configuration:\n",
      "id": "71d7078397bbf209",
      "level": "May",
      "line": 49,
      "quote": "The following are OPTIONAL for DynamoDb Table Encryption Configuration:",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config/structure.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config.md",
      "target_section": "structure",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "A [Legacy Config](#legacy-config)\nand a [Plaintext Policy](#plaintext-policy)\nboth specified on the same config is invalid,\nand MUST result in an error.\n",
      "id": "94c42aa465320cac",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 55,
      "quote": "A [Legacy Config](#legacy-config) and a [Plaintext Policy](#plaintext-policy) both specified on the same config is invalid, and MUST result in an error.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config/structure.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config.md",
      "target_section": "structure",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "A [Searchable Encryption Config](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md)\nand either a [Legacy Config](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-config)\nor a [Plaintext Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#plaintext-policy)\nbeing specified on the same config is invalid,\nand MUST result in an error.\n",
      "id": "e60fb0a100738228",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 64,
      "quote": "A [Searchable Encryption Config](../searchable-encryption/search-config.md) and either a [Legacy Config](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-config) or a [Plaintext Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#plaintext-policy) being specified on the same config is invalid, and MUST result in an error.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config/structure.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config.md",
      "target_section": "structure",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Unauthenticated Attribute Prefix MUST be a string.\n",
      "id": "de0c9a11d5af2d56",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 10,
      "quote": "Unauthenticated Attribute Prefix MUST be a string.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config/unauthenticated-attribute-prefix.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config.md",
      "target_section": "unauthenticated-attribute-prefix",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Unauthenticated Attributes MUST be a set of Attribute Names.\n",
      "id": "94312e124ccdee48",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 10,
      "quote": "Unauthenticated Attributes MUST be a set of Attribute Names.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config/unauthenticated-attributes.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/ddb-table-encryption-config.md",
      "target_section": "unauthenticated-attributes",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a [Legacy Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-policy) of\n`FORBID_LEGACY_ENCRYPT_FORBID_LEGACY_DECRYPT` is configured,\nand the input item [is an item written in the legacy format](#determining-legacy-items),\nthis operation MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "ab66acb2656b4439",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 66,
      "quote": "If a [Legacy Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-policy) of `FORBID_LEGACY_ENCRYPT_FORBID_LEGACY_DECRYPT` is configured, and the input item [is an item written in the legacy format](#determining-legacy-items), this operation MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a [Legacy Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-policy) of\n`FORCE_LEGACY_ENCRYPT_ALLOW_LEGACY_DECRYPT` or `FORBID_LEGACY_ENCRYPT_ALLOW_LEGACY_DECRYPT` is configured,\nand the input item [is an item written in the legacy format](#determining-legacy-items),\nthis operation MUST delegate decryption of this item to the\n[Legacy Encryptor](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-encryptor),\nusing the configured [Attribute Flags](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md) as input.\n",
      "id": "8954ccd0215aef4d",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 75,
      "quote": "If a [Legacy Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-policy) of `FORCE_LEGACY_ENCRYPT_ALLOW_LEGACY_DECRYPT` or `FORBID_LEGACY_ENCRYPT_ALLOW_LEGACY_DECRYPT` is configured, and the input item [is an item written in the legacy format](#determining-legacy-items), this operation MUST delegate decryption of this item to the [Legacy Encryptor](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-encryptor), using the configured [Attribute Flags](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md) as input.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The item returned by this operation MUST be the item outputted by the\n[Legacy Encryptor](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-encryptor).\n",
      "id": "6816aa2450e87b9f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 86,
      "quote": "The item returned by this operation MUST be the item outputted by the [Legacy Encryptor](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#legacy-encryptor).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a [Plaintext Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#plaintext-policy) of\n`FORCE_PLAINTEXT_WRITE_ALLOW_PLAINTEXT_READ` or `FORBID_PLAINTEXT_WRITE_ALLOW_PLAINTEXT_READ` is specified,\nand the input item [is a plaintext item](#determining-plaintext-items)\nthis operation MUST NOT decrypt the input item,\nand MUST passthrough that item as the output.\n",
      "id": "c9a4f291eb3051c5",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 93,
      "quote": "If a [Plaintext Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#plaintext-policy) of `FORCE_PLAINTEXT_WRITE_ALLOW_PLAINTEXT_READ` or `FORBID_PLAINTEXT_WRITE_ALLOW_PLAINTEXT_READ` is specified, and the input item [is a plaintext item](#determining-plaintext-items) this operation MUST NOT decrypt the input item, and MUST passthrough that item as the output.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This operation MUST create a\n[Required Encryption Context CMM](https://github.com/awslabs/private-aws-encryption-sdk-specification-staging/blob/dafny-verified/framework/required-encryption-context-cmm.md)\nwith the following inputs:\n",
      "id": "48285b8e4f4e4fa3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 103,
      "quote": "This operation MUST create a [Required Encryption Context CMM](https://github.com/awslabs/private-aws-encryption-sdk-specification-staging/blob/dafny-verified/framework/required-encryption-context-cmm.md) with the following inputs:",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Given the converted [Structured Data](../structured-encryption/structures.md#structured-data),\nthis operation MUST delegate decryption of this data to\nStructured Encryption Client's [Decrypt Structure](../structured-encryption/encrypt-structure.md),\nwith the following inputs:\n",
      "id": "13f4e9b3a981ffa6",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 111,
      "quote": "Given the converted [Structured Data](../structured-encryption/structures.md#structured-data), this operation MUST delegate decryption of this data to Structured Encryption Client's [Decrypt Structure](../structured-encryption/encrypt-structure.md), with the following inputs:",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- Encrypted Structured Data MUST be the Structured Data converted above.\n",
      "id": "140f6c007c50aafa",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 120,
      "quote": "- Encrypted Structured Data MUST be the Structured Data converted above.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- Authenticate Schema MUST be a [Authenticate Schema](../structured-encryption/structures.md#crypto-schema)\nbuilt with the following requirements:\n",
      "id": "6611315c3ecd5ee8",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 126,
      "quote": "- Authenticate Schema MUST be a [Authenticate Schema](../structured-encryption/structures.md#crypto-schema) built with the following requirements:",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- For every Attribute in the [input DynamoDB Item](#input-dynamodb-item)\nthat is in the [signature scope](#signature-scope),\nthere MUST exist a [SIGN Authenticate Action](../structured-encryption/structures.md#sign)\nin the Authenticate Schema,\nstring indexed at the top level by that attribute name.\n",
      "id": "ca4446080a50d26a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 133,
      "quote": "- For every Attribute in the [input DynamoDB Item](#input-dynamodb-item) that is in the [signature scope](#signature-scope), there MUST exist a [SIGN Authenticate Action](../structured-encryption/structures.md#sign) in the Authenticate Schema, string indexed at the top level by that attribute name.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- For every Attribute in the [input DynamoDB Item](#input-dynamodb-item)\nthat is not in the [signature scope](#signature-scope),\nthere MUST exist a [DO_NOT_SIGN Authenticate Action](../structured-encryption/structures.md#do_not_sign)\nin the Authenticate Schema,\nstring indexed at the top level by that attribute name.\n",
      "id": "261a5271e51fb8d7",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 143,
      "quote": "- For every Attribute in the [input DynamoDB Item](#input-dynamodb-item) that is not in the [signature scope](#signature-scope), there MUST exist a [DO_NOT_SIGN Authenticate Action](../structured-encryption/structures.md#do_not_sign) in the Authenticate Schema, string indexed at the top level by that attribute name.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- The number of Authenticate Actions in the Authenticate Schema\nMUST EQUAL the number of Attributes on the [input DynamoDB Item](#input-dynamodb-item).\n",
