      "level": "Must",
      "line": 153,
      "quote": "- The number of Authenticate Actions in the Authenticate Schema MUST EQUAL the number of Attributes on the [input DynamoDB Item](#input-dynamodb-item).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- Encryption Context MUST be the input Item's [DynamoDB Item Base Context](./encrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item-base-context).\n",
      "id": "e7bb4d0822e176ee",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 160,
      "quote": "- Encryption Context MUST be the input Item's [DynamoDB Item Base Context](./encrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item-base-context).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
