      "line": 166,
      "quote": "- CMM MUST be the CMM constructed above.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The output MUST also include a [Parsed Header](#parsed-header) that contains\ndata that was serialized into the header included in the output DynamoDb Item.\n",
      "id": "0f57cf5d2ba77a2f",
      "level": "Must",
