      "level": "Must",
      "line": 41,
      "quote": "If the Version Number is not 1 or 2, the operation MUST return an error.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/dynamodb-item-base-context.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "dynamodb-item-base-context",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This item MUST include an Attribute with a name that matches the\n[DynamoDB Partition Key Name](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#dynamodb-partition-key-name)\nconfigured on the [DynamoDB Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md).\n",
      "id": "300e653993109054",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 17,
      "quote": "This item MUST include an Attribute with a name that matches the [DynamoDB Partition Key Name](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#dynamodb-partition-key-name) configured on the [DynamoDB Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/input-dynamodb-item.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "input-dynamodb-item",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Otherwise this operation MUST yield an error.\n",
      "id": "2dbd3b7bd23389ff",
      "level": "Must",
