      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "An Attribute on a DynamoDB Item MUST NOT be considered as within the signature scope\nif it's Attribute Name is included in [Unauthenticated Attributes](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attributes)\nor if it's Attribute Name begins with the prefix specified in\n[Unauthenticated Attribute Prefix](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attribute-prefix).\n",
      "id": "ed82e93166651311",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 18,
      "quote": "An Attribute on a DynamoDB Item MUST NOT be considered as within the signature scope if it's Attribute Name is included in [Unauthenticated Attributes](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attributes) or if it's Attribute Name begins with the prefix specified in [Unauthenticated Attribute Prefix](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attribute-prefix).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/signature-scope.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "signature-scope",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Otherwise, Attributes MUST be considered as within the signature scope.\n",
      "id": "668fbbee0d0188d3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 27,
      "quote": "Otherwise, Attributes MUST be considered as within the signature scope.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/signature-scope.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item.md",
      "target_section": "signature-scope",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If an Authenticate Action other than DO_NOTHING is configured for an attribute name included in [Unauthenticated Attributes](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attributes)\nor beginning with the prefix specified in [Unauthenticated Attribute Prefix](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attribute-prefix),\nthis operation MUST yield an error.\n",
      "id": "f6f82a2f0fa39ac4",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 33,
      "quote": "If an Authenticate Action other than DO_NOTHING is configured for an attribute name included in [Unauthenticated Attributes](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attributes) or beginning with the prefix specified in [Unauthenticated Attribute Prefix](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#unauthenticated-attribute-prefix), this operation MUST yield an error.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/dynamodb-encryption-client/decrypt-item/signature-scope.toml",
