      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a [Plaintext Policy](./ddb-table-encryption-config.md#plaintext-policy) of\n`FORCE_PLAINTEXT_WRITE_ALLOW_PLAINTEXT_READ` is specified,\nthis operation MUST NOT encrypt the input item,\nand MUST passthrough that item as the output.\n",
