      "quote": "If a [cache entry](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md#cache-entry) exists, get beacon key MUST return the [entry materials](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md#materials).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/get-beacon-key-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "get-beacon-key-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `beacon key id` MUST be passed to the configured `KeyStore`'s `GetBeaconKey` operation.\n",
      "id": "7d7dae3db9e21c07",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 46,
      "quote": "The `beacon key id` MUST be passed to the configured `KeyStore`'s `GetBeaconKey` operation.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/get-beacon-key-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "get-beacon-key-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If `GetBeaconKey` fails get beacon key MUST fail.\n",
      "id": "b7a123a8761a3230",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 52,
      "quote": "If `GetBeaconKey` fails get beacon key MUST fail.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/get-beacon-key-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "get-beacon-key-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For every [standard beacons](beacons.md#standard-beacon-initialization) an HMAC key\nMUST be generated in accordance with [HMAC Key Generation](#hmac-key-generation).\n",
      "id": "a41b2ad56654aada",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 58,
      "quote": "For every [standard beacons](beacons.md#standard-beacon-initialization) an HMAC key MUST be generated in accordance with [HMAC Key Generation](#hmac-key-generation).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/get-beacon-key-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "get-beacon-key-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "[Beacon Key Materials](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#beacon-key-materials) MUST be generated\nwith the [beacon key id](#beacon-key-id) equal to the `beacon key id`\nand the [HMAC Keys](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#hmac-keys) equal to a map\nof every [standard beacons](beacons.md#standard-beacon-initialization) name to its generated HMAC key.\n",
      "id": "90bf62c5cc77d3c2",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 65,
      "quote": "[Beacon Key Materials](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#beacon-key-materials) MUST be generated with the [beacon key id](#beacon-key-id) equal to the `beacon key id` and the [HMAC Keys](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#hmac-keys) equal to a map of every [standard beacons](beacons.md#standard-beacon-initialization) name to its generated HMAC key.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/get-beacon-key-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "get-beacon-key-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "These materials MUST be put into the associated [Key Store Cache](#key-store-cache)\nwith an [Expiry Time](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md#expiry-time)\nequal to now + configured [cacheTTL](#cachettl).\n",
      "id": "08817b844f94f3a4",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 74,
      "quote": "These materials MUST be put into the associated [Key Store Cache](#key-store-cache) with an [Expiry Time](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md#expiry-time) equal to now + configured [cacheTTL](#cachettl).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/get-beacon-key-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "get-beacon-key-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "These cached materials MUST be returned.\n",
      "id": "e5adc28bae927ba7",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 82,
      "quote": "These cached materials MUST be returned.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/get-beacon-key-materials.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "get-beacon-key-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For each beacon HKDF-SHA512 MUST be used\nto calculate the key for individual beacon,\nusing the beacon key retrieved above as the initial key material with no salt.\n",
      "id": "f947e9b51565e2de",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 14,
      "quote": "For each beacon HKDF-SHA512 MUST be used to calculate the key for individual beacon, using the beacon key retrieved above as the initial key material with no salt.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/hmac-key-generation.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "hmac-key-generation",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `info` MUST be the concatenation of \"AWS_DBE_SCAN_BEACON\" encoded as UTF8\nand the beacon name.\n",
      "id": "3e68779f93672f75",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 22,
      "quote": "The `info` MUST be the concatenation of \"AWS_DBE_SCAN_BEACON\" encoded as UTF8 and the beacon name.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/hmac-key-generation.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "hmac-key-generation",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `expectedLength` MUST be 64 bytes.\n",
      "id": "d59e08e3681a0ad6",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 29,
      "quote": "The `expectedLength` MUST be 64 bytes.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/searchable-encryption/search-config/hmac-key-generation.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/searchable-encryption/search-config.md",
      "target_section": "hmac-key-generation",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
