      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For a [Single Key Store](#single-key-store-initialization) the [Entry Capacity](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md#entry-capacity)\nMUST be 1\nFor a [Multi Key Store](#multi-key-store-initialization) the [Entry Capacity](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/cryptographic-materials-cache.md#entry-capacity)\nMUST be key store's max cache size.\n",
