      "line": 34,
      "quote": "If any of these steps fails, this operation MUST halt and indicate a failure to the caller.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure/behavior.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "behavior",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- An entry MUST NOT exist with the key \"aws_dbe_head\" or \"aws_dbe_foot\".\n",
      "id": "df9cac0b62e13cdb",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 27,
      "quote": "- An entry MUST NOT exist with the key \"aws_dbe_head\" or \"aws_dbe_foot\".",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure/construct-decrypted-structured-data.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "construct-decrypted-structured-data",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- For every entry in the [input Auth List](#auth-list), other than the header and footer,\nan entry MUST exist with the same key in the output Crypto List.\n",
      "id": "164861a8b1dbd2ea",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 33,
      "quote": "- For every entry in the [input Auth List](#auth-list), other than the header and footer, an entry MUST exist with the same key in the output Crypto List.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure/construct-decrypted-structured-data.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "construct-decrypted-structured-data",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "- For every entry in the output Crypto List\nan entry MUST exist with the same key in the [input Auth List](#auth-list).\n",
      "id": "b097bed68d527a98",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 40,
      "quote": "- For every entry in the output Crypto List an entry MUST exist with the same key in the [input Auth List](#auth-list).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure/construct-decrypted-structured-data.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "construct-decrypted-structured-data",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the action is [ENCRYPT_AND_SIGN](./structures.md#encryptandsign)\nthis Terminal Data MUST have [Terminal Type ID](./structures.md#terminal-type-id)\nequal to the first two bytes of the input Terminal Data's value,\nand a value equal to the [decryption](#terminal-data-decryption) of the input Terminal Data's value.\n",
      "id": "6ff9675eeaa52649",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 47,
      "quote": "If the action is [ENCRYPT_AND_SIGN](./structures.md#encryptandsign) this Terminal Data MUST have [Terminal Type ID](./structures.md#terminal-type-id) equal to the first two bytes of the input Terminal Data's value, and a value equal to the [decryption](#terminal-data-decryption) of the input Terminal Data's value.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure/construct-decrypted-structured-data.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/decrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "construct-decrypted-structured-data",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Otherwise, this Terminal Data MUST have [Terminal Type ID](./structures.md#terminal-type-id) and\n[Terminal Value](./structures.md#terminal-value) equal to the input Terminal Data.\n",
      "id": "9c4cd24561d01dd3",
      "level": "Must",
