    },
    {
      "comment": "The HKDF algorithm used to calculate the Field Root Key MUST be the\n[Encryption Key KDF](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-encryption-key-derivation-settings)\nindicated by the algorithm suite, using a provided plaintext data key, no salt,\nand an info as calculated [above](#calculate-info)\n",
      "id": "bc786991f5bf7519",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 41,
      "quote": "The HKDF algorithm used to calculate the Field Root Key MUST be the [Encryption Key KDF](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-encryption-key-derivation-settings) indicated by the algorithm suite, using a provided plaintext data key, no salt, and an info as calculated [above](#calculate-info)",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `FieldRootKey` MUST be generated with the plaintext data key in the encryption materials\nand the Message ID generated for this Encrypted Structured Data.\n",
      "id": "dc48694bb65bf52b",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 50,
      "quote": "The `FieldRootKey` MUST be generated with the plaintext data key in the encryption materials and the Message ID generated for this Encrypted Structured Data.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The calculated Field Root MUST have length equal to the\n[algorithm suite's encryption key length](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-encryption-settings).\n",
      "id": "7d6d6eb6f08a887a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 57,
      "quote": "The calculated Field Root MUST have length equal to the [algorithm suite's encryption key length](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-encryption-settings).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `FieldKeyNonce` for a given offset MUST be 16 bytes comprised of\n| Field | Length | Interpretation |\n| ------------- | -------- | -------------- |\n| \"AwsDbeField\" | 11 | Literal Ascii String |\n| 0x2c | 1 | 44, the length of the eventual FieldKey |\n| offset | 4 | 32 bit integer representation of offset |\n",
      "id": "03b64312df7fa178",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 64,
      "quote": "The `FieldKeyNonce` for a given offset MUST be 16 bytes comprised of | Field | Length | Interpretation | | ------------- | -------- | -------------- | | \"AwsDbeField\" | 11 | Literal Ascii String | | 0x2c | 1 | 44, the length of the eventual FieldKey | | offset | 4 | 32 bit integer representation of offset |",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `FieldKey` for a given key and offset MUST be the first 44 bytes\nof the aes256ctr_stream\nof the `FieldRootKey` and the `FieldKeyNonce` of three times the given offset.\n",
      "id": "389a58616831cc42",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 75,
      "quote": "The `FieldKey` for a given key and offset MUST be the first 44 bytes of the aes256ctr_stream of the `FieldRootKey` and the `FieldKeyNonce` of three times the given offset.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `Cipherkey` MUST be the first 32 bytes of the `FieldKey`\n",
      "id": "60aaf19de68698b3",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 83,
      "quote": "The `Cipherkey` MUST be the first 32 bytes of the `FieldKey`",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `Nonce` MUST be the remaining 12 bytes of the `FieldKey`\n",
      "id": "bcc5c2fdfc7e41dd",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 89,
      "quote": "The `Nonce` MUST be the remaining 12 bytes of the `FieldKey`",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-cipherkey-and-nonce",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `info` used for the HKDF function MUST be\n| Field | Length |\n| -------------------- | -------- |\n| \"AWS_DBE_DERIVE_KEY\" | 18 |\n| Message ID | 32 |\n",
      "id": "11aa2b99b85cb1ac",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 11,
      "quote": "The `info` used for the HKDF function MUST be | Field | Length | | -------------------- | -------- | | \"AWS_DBE_DERIVE_KEY\" | 18 | | Message ID | 32 |",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-info.toml",
