      "target_section": "calculate-info",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The process used to generate this identifier MUST use a good source of randomness\nto make the chance of duplicate identifiers negligible.\n",
      "id": "bcb16d0e9cdc334e",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 23,
      "quote": "The process used to generate this identifier MUST use a good source of randomness to make the chance of duplicate identifiers negligible.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-intermediate-encrypted-structured-data.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-intermediate-encrypted-structured-data",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For every entry\nin the input [Crypto List](#crypto-list)\nthere MUST be an entry with the same [canonical path](./header.md#canonical-path)\nin Intermediate Encrypted Structured Data.\n",
      "id": "d9366e6139a73eba",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 30,
      "quote": "For every entry in the input [Crypto List](#crypto-list) there MUST be an entry with the same [canonical path](./header.md#canonical-path) in Intermediate Encrypted Structured Data.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-intermediate-encrypted-structured-data.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-intermediate-encrypted-structured-data",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "There MUST be no other entries in the Intermediate Encrypted Structured Data.\n",
      "id": "653207d2d8e7caa1",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 39,
      "quote": "There MUST be no other entries in the Intermediate Encrypted Structured Data.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/calculate-intermediate-encrypted-structured-data.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "calculate-intermediate-encrypted-structured-data",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If no [Crypto Action](./structures.md#crypto-action) is configured to be\n[SIGN_AND_INCLUDE_IN_ENCRYPTION_CONTEXT Crypto Action](./structures.md#sign_and_include_in_encryption_context)\nthen the input cmm and encryption context MUST be used unchanged.\n",
      "id": "da1fec09f8e760aa",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 33,
      "quote": "If no [Crypto Action](./structures.md#crypto-action) is configured to be [SIGN_AND_INCLUDE_IN_ENCRYPTION_CONTEXT Crypto Action](./structures.md#sign_and_include_in_encryption_context) then the input cmm and encryption context MUST be used unchanged.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/create-new-encryption-context-and-cmm.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "create-new-encryption-context-and-cmm",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Otherwise, this operation MUST add an [entry](../dynamodb-encryption-client/encrypt-item.md#base-context-value-version-2) to the encryption context for every\n[SIGN_AND_INCLUDE_IN_ENCRYPTION_CONTEXT Crypto Action](./structures.md#sign_and_include_in_encryption_context)\n[Terminal Data](./structures.md#terminal-data)\nin the input record, plus the Legend.\n",
      "id": "8d816b6725a8fdeb",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 41,
      "quote": "Otherwise, this operation MUST add an [entry](../dynamodb-encryption-client/encrypt-item.md#base-context-value-version-2) to the encryption context for every [SIGN_AND_INCLUDE_IN_ENCRYPTION_CONTEXT Crypto Action](./structures.md#sign_and_include_in_encryption_context) [Terminal Data](./structures.md#terminal-data) in the input record, plus the Legend.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/create-new-encryption-context-and-cmm.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "create-new-encryption-context-and-cmm",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "An error MUST be returned if any of the entries added to the encryption context in this step\nhave the same key as any entry already in the encryption context.\n",
      "id": "c7304a2956bc997d",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 50,
      "quote": "An error MUST be returned if any of the entries added to the encryption context in this step have the same key as any entry already in the encryption context.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/create-new-encryption-context-and-cmm.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "create-new-encryption-context-and-cmm",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The Legend MUST be named \"aws-crypto-legend\" and be a string with one character per attribute added above,\nwith a one-to-one correspondence with the attributes sorted by their UTF8 encoding,\neach character designating the original type of the attribute,\nto allow reversing of the [encoding](../dynamodb-encryption-client/encrypt-item.md#base-context-value-version-2).\n",
      "id": "607fcf6813455e10",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 57,
      "quote": "The Legend MUST be named \"aws-crypto-legend\" and be a string with one character per attribute added above, with a one-to-one correspondence with the attributes sorted by their UTF8 encoding, each character designating the original type of the attribute, to allow reversing of the [encoding](../dynamodb-encryption-client/encrypt-item.md#base-context-value-version-2).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure/create-new-encryption-context-and-cmm.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/encrypt-path-structure.md",
      "target_section": "create-new-encryption-context-and-cmm",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
