      "line": 51,
      "quote": "If the [Crypto Schema](#crypto-list) indicates a [Crypto Action](./structures.md#crypto-action) of [ENCRYPT_AND_SIGN](./structures.md#encryptandsign), the Terminal Data MUST have [Terminal Type ID](./structures.md#terminal-type-id) equal to 0xffff and the value MUST be the [encryption](#terminal-data-encryption) of the input's Terminal Data.",
