      "target_section": "retrieve-encryption-materials",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The algorithm suite used in all aspects of this operation MUST be\nthe algorithm suite in the\n[encryption materials](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#encryption-materials)\nreturned from the Get Encryption Materials call.\n",
