      "quote": "The algorithm suite used in all aspects of this operation MUST be the algorithm suite in the [encryption materials](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#encryption-materials) returned from the Get Encryption Materials call.",
