      "target_section": "output",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The canonical form of an encrypted field MUST be\n| Field | Length (bytes) | Interpreted as |\n| ----- | -------------- | -------------- |\n| The [canonical path](./header.md#canonical-path) of the field name | Variable | Bytes |\n| encrypted data length - 2 | 8 | 64-bit integer |\n| \"ENCRYPTED\" | 9 | Literal Ascii text |\n| TypeID | 2 | the type ID of the unencrypted Terminal |\n| value | Variable | the encrypted Terminal value |\n",
      "id": "27fc6b640acadf7c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 18,
      "quote": "The canonical form of an encrypted field MUST be | Field | Length (bytes) | Interpreted as | | ----- | -------------- | -------------- | | The [canonical path](./header.md#canonical-path) of the field name | Variable | Bytes | | encrypted data length - 2 | 8 | 64-bit integer | | \"ENCRYPTED\" | 9 | Literal Ascii text | | TypeID | 2 | the type ID of the unencrypted Terminal | | value | Variable | the encrypted Terminal value |",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/canonical-encrypted-field.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "canonical-encrypted-field",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The canonical form of a plaintext field MUST be\n| Field | Length (bytes) | Interpreted as |\n| ----- | -------------- | -------------- |\n| The [canonical path](./header.md#canonical-path) of the field name | Variable | Bytes |\n| data length | 8 | 64-bit integer |\n| \"PLAINTEXT\" | 9 | Literal Ascii text |\n| TypeID | 2 | the type ID of the Terminal |\n| value | Variable | the Terminal value |\n",
      "id": "6223cc3b29b3603f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 14,
      "quote": "The canonical form of a plaintext field MUST be | Field | Length (bytes) | Interpreted as | | ----- | -------------- | -------------- | | The [canonical path](./header.md#canonical-path) of the field name | Variable | Bytes | | data length | 8 | 64-bit integer | | \"PLAINTEXT\" | 9 | Literal Ascii text | | TypeID | 2 | the type ID of the Terminal | | value | Variable | the Terminal value |",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/canonical-plaintext-field.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "canonical-plaintext-field",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The canonical form of a record MUST be\n| Field | Length (bytes) | Interpreted as |\n| ----- | -------------- | -------------- |\n| header | Variable | The full serialized header with commitment |\n| AAD Length | 8 | 64-bit integer, the length of the following AAD data |\n| AAD | Variable | The serialization of the Encryption Context from the Encryption Materials |\n| Field Data | Variable | For each [signed field](#signed-fields), ordered lexicographically by [canonical path](./header.md#canonical-path), the [canonical field](#canonical-field).\n",
      "id": "a3e100f6c6e3a989",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 13,
      "quote": "The canonical form of a record MUST be | Field | Length (bytes) | Interpreted as | | ----- | -------------- | -------------- | | header | Variable | The full serialized header with commitment | | AAD Length | 8 | 64-bit integer, the length of the following AAD data | | AAD | Variable | The serialization of the Encryption Context from the Encryption Materials | | Field Data | Variable | For each [signed field](#signed-fields), ordered lexicographically by [canonical path](./header.md#canonical-path), the [canonical field](#canonical-field).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/canonical-record.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "canonical-record",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The [Terminal Value](./structures.md#terminal-value) of the footer MUST be\n",
      "id": "d26581372f582fdd",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 12,
      "quote": "The [Terminal Value](./structures.md#terminal-value) of the footer MUST be",
