      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "footer-format",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The canonical hash of a record MUST be the SHA384 of the canonical form of the record.\n",
      "id": "dc0a507e7b7fd3b6",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 7,
      "quote": "The canonical hash of a record MUST be the SHA384 of the canonical form of the record.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/hash-calculation.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "hash-calculation",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Verification MUST fail unless at least one of the [Recipient Tags](#recipient-tags)\nmatches a calculated recipient tag using the provided symmetricSigningKey.\n",
      "id": "3152c7de1a8d805a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 9,
      "quote": "Verification MUST fail unless at least one of the [Recipient Tags](#recipient-tags) matches a calculated recipient tag using the provided symmetricSigningKey.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/recipient-tag-verification.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "recipient-tag-verification",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Recipient Tag comparisons MUST be constant time operations.\n",
      "id": "6750346fe9a2016c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 16,
      "quote": "Recipient Tag comparisons MUST be constant time operations.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/recipient-tag-verification.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "recipient-tag-verification",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "There MUST be one Recipient Tag for each Encrypted Data Key in the [header](./header.md#encrypted-data-keys)\n",
      "id": "f914fa5afef93d92",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 22,
      "quote": "There MUST be one Recipient Tag for each Encrypted Data Key in the [header](./header.md#encrypted-data-keys)",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/recipient-tags.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "recipient-tags",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "the Recipient Tag MUST be MUST be calculated over the [Canonical Hash](#canonical-hash)\nusing the [symmetric signature algorithm](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-signature-settings)\nindicated in the algorithm suite,\nand the\n[symmetric signing keys](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#symmetric-signing-keys)\nin the encryption materials.\n",
      "id": "684d4e0cf6fd9804",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 28,
      "quote": "the Recipient Tag MUST be MUST be calculated over the [Canonical Hash](#canonical-hash) using the [symmetric signature algorithm](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-signature-settings) indicated in the algorithm suite, and the [symmetric signing keys](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#symmetric-signing-keys) in the encryption materials.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/recipient-tags.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "recipient-tags",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "the HMAC values MUST have the same order as the\n[symmetric signing keys](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#symmetric-signing-keys)\nused to calculate them.\n",
      "id": "4cd1bfc7199732aa",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 39,
      "quote": "the HMAC values MUST have the same order as the [symmetric signing keys](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/structures.md#symmetric-signing-keys) used to calculate them.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/recipient-tags.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "recipient-tags",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the footer contains a signature, this signature MUST be verified using the\n[asymmetric signature algorithm](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-signature-settings)\nindicated by the algorithm suite.\n",
      "id": "35e64e548c2d75d2",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 9,
      "quote": "If the footer contains a signature, this signature MUST be verified using the [asymmetric signature algorithm](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-signature-settings) indicated by the algorithm suite.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/signature-verification.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "signature-verification",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The signature MUST be included in the footer if the flavor\nin the [header](./header.md#format-flavor) is 0x01\nand MUST NOT be included in the footer if the flavor\nin the [header](./header.md#format-flavor) is 0x00.\n",
      "id": "d8a27d7a79dd4ebd",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 17,
      "quote": "The signature MUST be included in the footer if the flavor in the [header](./header.md#format-flavor) is 0x01 and MUST NOT be included in the footer if the flavor in the [header](./header.md#format-flavor) is 0x00.",
