      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "signature",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `signature`, if it exists, MUST be calculated over the [Canonical Hash](#canonical-hash),\nusing the asymmetric signing key in the encryption materials.\n",
      "id": "1c67f06dfb1d5d75",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 26,
      "quote": "The `signature`, if it exists, MUST be calculated over the [Canonical Hash](#canonical-hash), using the asymmetric signing key in the encryption materials.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/footer/signature.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/footer.md",
      "target_section": "signature",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `signature`, if it exists, MUST be calculated using the\n[asymmetric signature algorithm](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-signature-settings)\nindicated by the algorithm suite.\n",
      "id": "ac8ada92dc3960f7",
