      "line": 33,
      "quote": "The `signature`, if it exists, MUST be calculated using the [asymmetric signature algorithm](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-signature-settings) indicated by the algorithm suite.",
