      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/header.md",
      "target_section": "canonical-path",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For Structured Data in Structured Data Lists, this MUST be a 0x23 byte (# in UTF-8),\nfollowed by the numerical index.\n",
      "id": "7d65def2ca5c7257",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 39,
      "quote": "For Structured Data in Structured Data Lists, this MUST be a 0x23 byte (# in UTF-8), followed by the numerical index.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/header/canonical-path.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/header.md",
      "target_section": "canonical-path",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "For Structured Data in Structured Data Maps, this MUST be a 0x24 byte ($ in UTF-8),\nfollowed by the length of the key, followed by the key as a UTF8 string.\n",
      "id": "c5433be135095289",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 46,
      "quote": "For Structured Data in Structured Data Maps, this MUST be a 0x24 byte ($ in UTF-8), followed by the length of the key, followed by the key as a UTF8 string.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/header/canonical-path.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/header.md",
      "target_section": "canonical-path",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The HKDF used to calculate the Commitment Key MUST be the\n[Commit Key KDF](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-commit-key-derivation-settings)\nindicated by the algorithm suite.\n",
      "id": "fc5f15084383cc1d",
