      "quote": "The HKDF used to calculate the Commitment Key MUST be the [Commit Key KDF](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-commit-key-derivation-settings) indicated by the algorithm suite.",
