      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/header.md",
      "target_section": "commit-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The calculated Commitment Key MUST have length equal to the\n[algorithm suite's encryption key length](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-encryption-settings).\n",
      "id": "0606528f257a8da6",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 31,
      "quote": "The calculated Commitment Key MUST have length equal to the [algorithm suite's encryption key length](../../submodules/MaterialProviders/aws-encryption-sdk-specification/framework/algorithm-suites.md#algorithm-suites-encryption-settings).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/header/commit-key.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/header.md",
      "target_section": "commit-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The `info` used for the HKDF function MUST be\n| Field | Length |\n| -------------------- | -------- |\n| \"AWS_DBE_COMMIT_KEY\" | 18 |\n| Message ID | 32 |\n",
      "id": "a67615a5225cfc09",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 38,
      "quote": "The `info` used for the HKDF function MUST be | Field | Length | | -------------------- | -------- | | \"AWS_DBE_COMMIT_KEY\" | 18 | | Message ID | 32 |",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/header/commit-key.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/header.md",
      "target_section": "commit-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The HKDF calculation MUST use a supplied key, no salt, and an `info` as described above.\n",
      "id": "66440a37db3c766a",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 48,
      "quote": "The HKDF calculation MUST use a supplied key, no salt, and an `info` as described above.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/header/commit-key.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/header.md",
      "target_section": "commit-key",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The commit key calculation described above MUST be performed with the record's plaintext data key\nand the header's message id.\n",
      "id": "5983893fdb05995b",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 54,
      "quote": "The commit key calculation described above MUST be performed with the record's plaintext data key and the header's message id.",
