    {
      "comment": "During [Encrypt Structure](encrypt-structure.md#encrypt-structure)\nand [Decrypt Structure](decrypt-structure.md#decrypt-structure),\nDO_NOT_ENCRYPT signifies that the [Terminal Data](#terminal-data)\nMUST have an equal [Terminal Value](#terminal-value) and\n[Terminal Type Id](#terminal-type-id) as the the Terminal Data\nin the same location in the resulting encrypted [Structured Data](#structured-data).\n",
      "id": "67bdc347b6017b1c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 13,
      "quote": "During [Encrypt Structure](encrypt-structure.md#encrypt-structure) and [Decrypt Structure](decrypt-structure.md#decrypt-structure), DO_NOT_ENCRYPT signifies that the [Terminal Data](#terminal-data) MUST have an equal [Terminal Value](#terminal-value) and [Terminal Type Id](#terminal-type-id) as the the Terminal Data in the same location in the resulting encrypted [Structured Data](#structured-data).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/structures/do-not-encrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/structures.md",
      "target_section": "do-not-encrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "During [Encrypt Structure](./encrypt-structure.md),\nDO_NOT_SIGN signifies that the [Terminal Data](#terminal-data) MUST NOT be included in the signature calculations\non the footer.\n",
      "id": "1f38a4f677e18354",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 13,
      "quote": "During [Encrypt Structure](./encrypt-structure.md), DO_NOT_SIGN signifies that the [Terminal Data](#terminal-data) MUST NOT be included in the signature calculations on the footer.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/structures/do-not-sign.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/structures.md",
      "target_section": "do-not-sign",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "During [Decrypt Structure](./decrypt-structure.md),\nDO_NOT_SIGN signifies that the [Terminal Data](#terminal-data) MUST NOT be authenticated,\nand thus not be included in the verification of the signatures on the footer.\n",
      "id": "9cf3c9d3448280e5",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 21,
      "quote": "During [Decrypt Structure](./decrypt-structure.md), DO_NOT_SIGN signifies that the [Terminal Data](#terminal-data) MUST NOT be authenticated, and thus not be included in the verification of the signatures on the footer.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/structures/do-not-sign.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/structures.md",
      "target_section": "do-not-sign",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "During [Encrypt Structure](encrypt-structure.md#encrypt-structure),\nENCRYPT signifies that the [Terminal Value](#terminal-value) in the [Terminal Data](#terminal-data)\nMUST be encrypted in the resulting encrypted [Structured Data](#structured-data).\n",
      "id": "a2ac6849747a0a4c",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 13,
      "quote": "During [Encrypt Structure](encrypt-structure.md#encrypt-structure), ENCRYPT signifies that the [Terminal Value](#terminal-value) in the [Terminal Data](#terminal-data) MUST be encrypted in the resulting encrypted [Structured Data](#structured-data).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/structures/encrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/structures.md",
      "target_section": "encrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "During [Decrypt Structure](decrypt-structure.md#decrypt-structure),\nENCRYPT signifies that the [Terminal Value](#terminal-value) in the [Terminal Data](#terminal-data)\nMUST be attempted to be decrypted.\n",
