      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/structures/encrypt.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/structures.md",
      "target_section": "encrypt",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "These structures define a group of related fields that MUST hold certain properties.\n",
