      "level": "Must",
      "line": 20,
      "quote": "If [Terminal Value](#terminal-value) is to be interpreted as raw bytes, the Terminal Type ID MUST be 0xFFFF.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/structures/terminal-type-id.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/structures.md",
      "target_section": "terminal-type-id",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Any other value prefixed by 0xFF is reserved and MUST NOT be used.\n",
      "id": "e0c6cbbd736cae7d",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 27,
      "quote": "Any other value prefixed by 0xFF is reserved and MUST NOT be used.",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/structures/terminal-type-id.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/structures.md",
      "target_section": "terminal-type-id",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Terminal Value MUST be a sequence of bytes, and MAY be empty (zero-length).\n",
      "id": "ea8be5898a02bba2",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 9,
      "quote": "Terminal Value MUST be a sequence of bytes, and MAY be empty (zero-length).",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/structures/terminal-value.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/structures.md",
      "target_section": "terminal-value",
      "type": "SPEC"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If these bytes are to be deserialized, these bytes MUST be interpreted as the type indicated in this Terminal Data's [Terminal Type ID](#terminal-type-id).D\n",
      "id": "8edf04a85665558f",
      "level": "Must",
      "line": 15,
      "quote": "If these bytes are to be deserialized, these bytes MUST be interpreted as the type indicated in this Terminal Data's [Terminal Type ID](#terminal-type-id).D",
      "source": "compliance/specification/structured-encryption/structures/terminal-value.toml",
      "target_path": "specification/structured-encryption/structures.md",
      "target_section": "terminal-value",
      "type": "SPEC"
    }
  ],
