          "title": "Decrypt after GetItem"
        },
        {
          "id": "decrypt-after-putitem",
          "lines": [
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "56b189c761fd9445",
                  "3bc00831548e467b"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "After a [PutItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_PutItem.html)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "56b189c761fd9445",
                  "3bc00831548e467b"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "call is made to DynamoDB,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "56b189c761fd9445",
                  "3bc00831548e467b"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "the resulting response MUST be modified before"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "56b189c761fd9445",
                  "3bc00831548e467b"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "being returned to the caller if:"
              }
            ],
            "",
            "- there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the",
            "  [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration)",
            "  with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name)",
            "  equal to the `TableName` on the PutItem request.",
            "- the response contains [Attributes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_PutItem.html#DDB-PutItem-response-Attributes).",
            "  The response will contain Attributes if the related PutItem request's",
            "  [ReturnValues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_PutItem.html#DDB-PutItem-request-ReturnValues)",
            "  had a value of `ALL_OLD` and the PutItem call replaced a pre-existing item.",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "80b2c02dbdb58f25",
                  "f9218d8bcae7921d"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "In this case, the [Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md) MUST perform"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "80b2c02dbdb58f25",
                  "f9218d8bcae7921d"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "[Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "80b2c02dbdb58f25",
                  "f9218d8bcae7921d"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "[DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "80b2c02dbdb58f25",
                  "f9218d8bcae7921d"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "is the `Attributes` field in the original response"
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "0ff58570bac90dad",
                  "96e7109d59c33caf"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "a7709abe2333899e",
                  "7a2dafb24cd81286"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "The PutItem response's `Attributes` field MUST be"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "a7709abe2333899e",
                  "7a2dafb24cd81286"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "replaced by the encrypted DynamoDb Item outputted above."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "3bc00831548e467b",
            "3bc00831548e467b",
            "3bc00831548e467b",
            "3bc00831548e467b",
            "f9218d8bcae7921d",
            "f9218d8bcae7921d",
            "f9218d8bcae7921d",
            "f9218d8bcae7921d",
            "96e7109d59c33caf",
            "7a2dafb24cd81286",
            "7a2dafb24cd81286"
          ],
          "title": "Decrypt after PutItem"
        },
        {
          "id": "decrypt-after-deleteitem",
          "lines": [
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9cbd8ed946a95acc",
                  "bbb0acae730dc775"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "After a [DeleteItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_DeleteItem.html)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9cbd8ed946a95acc",
                  "bbb0acae730dc775"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "call is made to DynamoDB,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9cbd8ed946a95acc",
                  "bbb0acae730dc775"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "the resulting response MUST be modified before"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9cbd8ed946a95acc",
                  "bbb0acae730dc775"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "being returned to the caller if:"
              }
            ],
            "",
            "- there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the",
            "  [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration)",
            "  with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name)",
            "  equal to the `TableName` on the DeleteItem request.",
            "- the response contains [Attributes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_DeleteItem.html#DDB-DeleteItem-response-Attributes).",
            "  The response will contain Attributes if the related DeleteItem request's",
            "  [ReturnValues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_DeleteItem.html#DDB-DeleteItem-request-ReturnValues)",
            "  had a value of `ALL_OLD` and an item was deleted.",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8dea89a0b42dbba0",
                  "c14ff3d7668a7dcf"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "In this case, the [Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md) MUST perform"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8dea89a0b42dbba0",
                  "c14ff3d7668a7dcf"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "[Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8dea89a0b42dbba0",
                  "c14ff3d7668a7dcf"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "[DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8dea89a0b42dbba0",
                  "c14ff3d7668a7dcf"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "is the `Attributes` field in the original response"
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "7d1953f4bb636546",
                  "5ef6cb5c77ae9ff9"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "29ba4902055c310f",
                  "cac8b7cadd9b3300"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "The DeleteItem response's `Attributes` field MUST be"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "29ba4902055c310f",
                  "cac8b7cadd9b3300"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "replaced by the encrypted DynamoDb Item outputted above."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "bbb0acae730dc775",
            "bbb0acae730dc775",
            "bbb0acae730dc775",
            "bbb0acae730dc775",
            "c14ff3d7668a7dcf",
            "c14ff3d7668a7dcf",
            "c14ff3d7668a7dcf",
            "c14ff3d7668a7dcf",
            "5ef6cb5c77ae9ff9",
            "cac8b7cadd9b3300",
            "cac8b7cadd9b3300"
          ],
          "title": "Decrypt after DeleteItem"
        },
        {
          "id": "decrypt-after-updateitem",
          "lines": [
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8ef7237d0bc26014",
                  "325ead66d2d6ad6e"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "After a [UpdateItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_UpdateItem.html)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8ef7237d0bc26014",
                  "325ead66d2d6ad6e"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "call is made to DynamoDB,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8ef7237d0bc26014",
                  "325ead66d2d6ad6e"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "the resulting response MUST be modified before"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8ef7237d0bc26014",
                  "325ead66d2d6ad6e"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "being returned to the caller if:"
              }
            ],
            "",
            "- there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the",
            "  [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration)",
            "  with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name)",
            "  equal to the `TableName` on the UpdateItem request.",
            "- the response contains [Attributes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_UpdateItem.html#DDB-UpdateItem-response-Attributes).",
            "- the original UpdateItem request had a",
            "  [ReturnValues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_UpdateItem.html#DDB-UpdateItem-request-ReturnValues)",
            "  with a value of `ALL_OLD` or `ALL_NEW`.",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "aa8da81c7a07f1a8",
                  "f493d85bc8bcee01"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "In this case, the [Item Encryptor](./ddb-item-encryptor.md) MUST perform"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "aa8da81c7a07f1a8",
                  "f493d85bc8bcee01"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "[Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "aa8da81c7a07f1a8",
                  "f493d85bc8bcee01"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "[DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "aa8da81c7a07f1a8",
                  "f493d85bc8bcee01"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "is the `Attributes` field in the original response"
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "b11117e4becdd950",
                  "5bd8491ed93dfa4b"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "15518b014ae972a9",
                  "8d1749b2e91ecb28"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "The UpdateItem response's `Attributes` field MUST be"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "15518b014ae972a9",
                  "8d1749b2e91ecb28"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "replaced by the encrypted DynamoDb Item outputted above."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "718e776a713a3f45",
                  "a89023ec7742fd06"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "In all other cases, the UpdateItem response MUST NOT be modified."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "b3d9b5f29f10b0c7",
                  "5417d6defab40aac"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "Additionally, if a value of `UPDATED_OLD` or `UPDATED_NEW` was used,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "b3d9b5f29f10b0c7",
                  "5417d6defab40aac"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "and any Attributes in the response are authenticated"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "b3d9b5f29f10b0c7",
                  "5417d6defab40aac"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "per the [DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration),"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "b3d9b5f29f10b0c7",
                  "5417d6defab40aac"
                ],
                "status_id": 1,
                "text": "an error MUST be raised."
              }
            ],
            "Given that we [validate UpdateItem requests](#validate-before-updateitem),",
            "and thus updates will not modify any signed field,",
            "an error here would indicate a bug in",
            "our library or a bug within DynamoDB."
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "325ead66d2d6ad6e",
            "325ead66d2d6ad6e",
            "325ead66d2d6ad6e",
            "325ead66d2d6ad6e",
            "f493d85bc8bcee01",
            "f493d85bc8bcee01",
            "f493d85bc8bcee01",
            "f493d85bc8bcee01",
            "5bd8491ed93dfa4b",
            "8d1749b2e91ecb28",
            "8d1749b2e91ecb28",
            "a89023ec7742fd06",
            "5417d6defab40aac",
            "5417d6defab40aac",
            "5417d6defab40aac",
            "5417d6defab40aac"
          ],
          "title": "Decrypt after UpdateItem"
        },
        {
          "id": "decrypt-after-batchgetitem",
          "lines": [
            "After a [BatchGetItem](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_BatchGetItem.html)",
            "call is made to DynamoDB :",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9239ecaeab8df17f",
                  "76b4808805e4c500"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "For each list item under each key in `Responses`,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9239ecaeab8df17f",
                  "76b4808805e4c500"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "if there is a configured Item Encryptor with [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name) equal to the key,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9239ecaeab8df17f",
                  "76b4808805e4c500"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "that Item Encryptor MUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) where the input"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9239ecaeab8df17f",
                  "76b4808805e4c500"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "[DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "9239ecaeab8df17f",
                  "76b4808805e4c500"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "is the `Item` field in the original response."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "2cbab5f561e70789",
                  "2da6b7058954468d"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "Beacons MUST be [removed](ddb-support.md#removebeacons) from the result."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "85ed362370568055",
                  "8eb80e4cf474014f"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "Each of these items on the original response MUST be replaced"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "85ed362370568055",
                  "8eb80e4cf474014f"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "with a value that is equivalent to"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "85ed362370568055",
                  "8eb80e4cf474014f"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "this result."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "6432c3ae5cf874d2",
                  "6bd91537cd497d5e"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "If any [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) operation fails,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "6432c3ae5cf874d2",
                  "6bd91537cd497d5e"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "BatchGetItem MUST yield an error."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "76b4808805e4c500",
            "76b4808805e4c500",
            "76b4808805e4c500",
            "76b4808805e4c500",
            "76b4808805e4c500",
            "2da6b7058954468d",
            "8eb80e4cf474014f",
            "8eb80e4cf474014f",
            "8eb80e4cf474014f",
            "6bd91537cd497d5e",
            "6bd91537cd497d5e"
          ],
          "title": "Decrypt after BatchGetItem"
        },
        {
          "id": "decrypt-after-scan",
          "lines": [
            "After a [Scan](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_Scan.html)",
            "call is made to DynamoDB :",
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "4867b97a303f25e9"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "For each list entry in `Items` in the response,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "4867b97a303f25e9"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "if there exists an Item Encryptor specified within the"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "4867b97a303f25e9"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "[DynamoDB Encryption Client Config](#dynamodb-encryption-client-configuration)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "4867b97a303f25e9"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "with a [DynamoDB Table Name](./ddb-item-encryptor.md#dynamodb-table-name)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "4867b97a303f25e9"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "equal to the `TableName` on the request,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "4867b97a303f25e9"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "the corresponding Item Encryptor MUST perform [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "4867b97a303f25e9"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "where the input [DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "4867b97a303f25e9"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "is this list entry."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "f58032b0c93d361a",
                  "d321aa3764710125"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "Each of these entries on the original response MUST be replaced"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "f58032b0c93d361a",
                  "d321aa3764710125"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "with the resulting decrypted"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "f58032b0c93d361a",
                  "d321aa3764710125"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "[DynamoDB Item](./decrypt-item.md#dynamodb-item-1)."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8b574deeb4d0a404"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "If any [Decrypt Item](./decrypt-item.md) operation fails,"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "8b574deeb4d0a404"
                ],
                "status_id": 8,
                "text": "Scan MUST yield an error."
              }
            ],
            "",
            [
              {
                "annotation_ids": [
                  "5d3a7f31dfc68960",
                  "bbcbba70148e82a0"
                ],
                "status_id": 7,
                "text": "The resulting decrypted response MUST be [filtered](ddb-support.md#scanoutputforbeacons) from the result."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "requirements": [
            "4867b97a303f25e9",
            "4867b97a303f25e9",
            "4867b97a303f25e9",
            "4867b97a303f25e9",
